# Frontend (Vite) Environment Configuration
# Only non-secret values belong here: anything VITE_* is public in the browser bundle.
#
# For Local Development and Vercel Full-Stack deployment:
# Leave VITE_API_BASE_URL unset or commented out. The app will default to /api:
# - In local dev: Vite proxies /api -> http://localhost:4000
# - On Vercel: Vercel routes /api -> api/index.js serverless function
#
# Only uncomment and set this if hosting the backend on an external server (e.g. Render/Railway):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend-api.com/api
